{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfnxUCy2fegpDEDvSePcS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking back at what I used, here are the concrete issues:\n\n1. **`--assume-balance` syntax not documented.** The skill says it \"gives the Pot's USDC account the budget\" but doesn't show the actual format. I had to infer `--assume-balance USDC:500` works. Should be: `--assume-balance <mint>:<whole-tokens>`.\n\n2. **Special account keywords (`pot:`, `mint:`, `pot:USDC`) undefined.** The accounts.json example uses these but never explains what they are or that they're special syntax. A reader has to guess they're Kitchen keywords.\n\n3. **Empty slots behavior not explained.** The example shows unused slots as `11111111111111111111111111111111` (System program) but doesn't explain why or whether they're actually loaded into the transaction. This matters for understanding account overhead and the \"five fit one cook\" claim.\n\n4. **`--per-venue` endpoint dependency hidden.** The skill says use `--per-venue` to get one pool per supported venue, but doesn't explain that endpoint limitations mean you often get fewer. The `8 of 9 venues could not be read` warning was unclear—Raydium succeeded, but a reader might think the command partially failed.\n\n5. **accounts.json template over-detailed.** The example shows all four slots fully filled. It doesn't clearly state that unused slots must be System program addresses and will be skipped, making it hard to know what's required vs. boilerplate.\n\nMost important first: #1 (syntax), #2 (undefined keywords), #4 (endpoint expectations)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28076,"cache_read_input_tokens":23461,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28076},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a636ce7-4902-4abc-85b2-31fddf4c499e","uuid":"f461d585-5a48-451e-8441-5f7712bc7cc3","timestamp":"2026-10-07T13:30:03.626Z","request_id":"req_011CfnxUCkspxacAbVYcb9oj"}
